@Tabiji.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5080

### Liveness probe
GET {{Tabiji.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Readiness probe (checks the database)
GET {{Tabiji.Api_HostAddress}}/health/ready
Accept: application/json

### Create a trip
POST {{Tabiji.Api_HostAddress}}/api/trips
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Rome & Amalfi",
  "destination": "Italy",
  "startsOn": "2027-04-01",
  "endsOn": "2027-04-14"
}

### Get a trip by id
GET {{Tabiji.Api_HostAddress}}/api/trips/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json

### OpenAPI document
GET {{Tabiji.Api_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json

### Register an account (200, empty body; does not sign in)
POST {{Tabiji.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "traveller@example.com",
  "password": "CorrectHorse42"
}

### Sign in and receive the authentication cookie (200, empty body)
# useSessionCookies=true gives a cookie that ends with the browser session.
POST {{Tabiji.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login?useCookies=true
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "traveller@example.com",
  "password": "CorrectHorse42"
}

### Who am I? (200 either way)
GET {{Tabiji.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/session
Accept: application/json

### Collect the antiforgery token
GET {{Tabiji.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/csrf
Accept: application/json

### Sign out (204; send X-XSRF-TOKEN with the token above)
POST {{Tabiji.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

### Password recovery is unavailable until email delivery is configured (503)
POST {{Tabiji.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/forgotPassword
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "traveller@example.com"
}
